  "processing_chain": "The bound VCTK v0.80 README documents DPA 4035 recording at 96 kHz/24-bit in a hemi-anechoic chamber, conversion to 16-bit, downsampling to 48 kHz using a tool named there as 'STPK', and manual endpointing. The primary paper documents subsequent clean-waveform normalization and trimming of leading and trailing silence segments longer than 200 ms before noisy derivation. The clean derivative is therefore confirmed PCM but not an untouched microphone master.",
